# Alchemist

Follow `AGENTS.md` before changing this repo.

- Package is `alchemist/`. Run with `python -m alchemist`. Do not add scripts at the repo root.
- Game flow goes in `alchemist/tasks/`. A task takes a `Bot` and uses `bot.step`, `bot.visible`, `bot.log`. It does not call pyautogui, cv2, or `vision.find`.
- Screen matching stays in `vision.py`. Clicks stay in `input.py`. Windows admin and DPI stay in `platform.py`.
- Edit gather/craft lists in `schedules.py`. Edit thresholds and paths in `settings.py`.
- Template name `gather/mushroom` maps to `templates/gather/mushroom.png`.
- On a failed step, raise `StepFailed(message, name)` with the template name.
- Pass `Settings` into `Bot`. Do not bring back module-level threshold or delay globals.
- Keep DPI awareness before any `pyautogui` import. Keep held clicks in `input.click_at`.
